# Braced conditionals

The selected description is {{ description }} and the adjusted priority is
{{ adjustedPriority }}.

```amx
let priority: Number = 7
let description: String = if priority >= 5 {
  return "high"
} else {
  return "normal"
}

let adjustedPriority: Number = priority
if priority >= 5 {
  adjustedPriority += 1
} else {
  adjustedPriority += 2
}
```
